    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one more thing—sometimes even with a deload, it feels like there's this weird, inexplicable wall they hit where progress just stops for no reason at all. is there any physiological way to explain why a plateau can feel so stagnant and sudden, or is it just random?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
